-# Schema: tools/cockpit/README.md. status = active | finished | archived. Put the GitHub URL in `url:`.
-# `related:` ids cross-link to the project cards a repo backs. Edit in served mode on the Code tab.
-# Each entry has a `key`, its short name, unique in this file; a write and Edit in File address the entry by it.
-title: Code
-intro: "Personal projects, research tools, and finished repos, plus the portfolio's code-availability coverage (which projects have a code deposit, which don't). A curated list; add your GitHub URLs (edit in the cockpit). Paper deposits also surface from each project's `code_availability`."
